msgid ""
""
"Vovk-Sellke Maximum <em>p</em>-Ratio: Based on the <em>p</em>-value,   the"
"maximum possible odds in favor of H%1$s over H%2$s equals   1/(-e <em>p</em>"
"log(<em>p</em>)) for <em>p</em> %3$s .37   (Sellke, Bayarri, & Berger, 2001)."
msgstr ""
"Vovk-Sellke maximum <em>p</em>-ratio: op basis van de"
"<em>p</em>-waarde is de maximaal mogelijke kansverhouding ten gunste"
"van H%1$s ten opzichte van H%2$s gelijk aan 1/(-e"
"<em>p</em>log(<em>p</em>)) voor <em>p</em> %3$s, 37 (Sellke, Bayarri,"
"& Berger, 2001)."

